onchainos agent update --agent-id 6077 --service "{""operation"":""create"",""serviceName"":""TACIT Watch"",""serviceDescription"":""TACIT Watch continuously monitors public APIs and websites for availability, latency, content updates, and JSON schema changes.\n\nSupported monitoring modes\n\n• status\nChecks HTTP response codes.\n\n• content\nDetects page or API response changes.\n\n• schema\nDetects changes in JSON response structure.\n\n• latency\nMeasures response time and alerts when thresholds are exceeded.\n\nParameters\n\nurl (required)\nHTTP or HTTPS URL to monitor.\n\ncheckType (required)\nAllowed values: status, content, schema, latency.\n\nintervalMinutes (optional)\nPolling interval in minutes. Default: 5.\n\nthreshold (optional)\nStatus code or latency threshold.\n\nwebhookUrl (optional)\nWebhook endpoint that receives notifications.\n\nExample Request\n\nPOST /api/watch\n\n{\n  \""url\"": \""https://api.github.com\"",\n  \""checkType\"": \""status\"",\n  \""intervalMinutes\"": 5\n}\n\nExample Success Response\n\n{\n  \""target\"": {\n    \""id\"": \""abc123\"",\n    \""status\"": \""watching\""\n  }\n}\n\nExample Error Response\n\n{\n  \""error\"": \""Invalid URL\""\n}\n\nTypical use cases\n\n• Monitor production APIs\n• Watch NFT mint pages\n• Detect website updates\n• Track backend service health"",""serviceType"":""A2MCP"",""fee"":""0.02"",""endpoint"":""https://watch-dog-agent.vercel.app/api/watch""}"
